  {
    "episode_id": 94779,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/4/94779.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "I'm so glad you're here. You were actually in Michigan not too long ago. I got to see you in Grand Rapids, which was very exciting to have some love paid to the great state of Michigan. But then right after you left Grand Rapids, we had a pretty devastating situation when we found out that Ruby Garcia was the victim of a horrible murder from that at the hands of an illegal alien. We know that this is a huge problem in our country. We're hearing more and more of these. We've got the Lake and Riley story, the Ruby Garcia story, and that's just in the last few months. And obviously there's concern among families across the country that this type of situation will continue not to mention all the other dangerous situations with the border, but We keep hearing on the mainstream media. Why are Republicans holding up this border bill? It's bipartisan. So I want you to explain what this border bill really is.",
