    "turn_text": "see this flood, illegal is coming to the country, because this allows, you know, from a census standpoint, you count number of citizens, number of people, not necessarily American citizens, number of people, that's what complicates congressional seats in electoral college. So there's a method behind their madness right now in why they want to see open borders.",
