    "turn_text": "Dude, you're exactly right. That was one of the provisions here that just didn't make sense to so many of us. The number was a little over 5,000 per day, and here's the problem. is that the Mexican cartels, we just basically use that as like, that's their code every day. Because the Mexican cartels have command and control over the southern border. President Biden through his lawless actions has basically yielded the power and the command and control responsibilities now to Mexican cartels in the Southern Board. I've made four trips down to the Southern Board. I've seen this firsthand. It's shocking when you go down there. Of course, many of your listeners have seen the images. I've seen it firsthand. I've been on the board spending time from 11 p.m. to 6 a.m. working the night shift with our border bushel agents and seeing it firsthand. But when you put these so-called quotas that were proposed in that bill, it basically just green lights the ability to bring about 1.5 to 1.6 million illegals across our southern border every year.",
