        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "This generation appears to reject rigid political identities and commitments.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "A 'silent majority' similar to the one seen in 2016 may currently exist and could be larger than before.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker finds it interesting that some independents vote for Trump despite rejecting party identification.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Polling data is difficult to interpret accurately.",
        "confidence": 0.8
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
