      },
      {
        "text": "The alternative to comparing politicians to God is to focus on societal and cultural transformation through community action.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Trump’s position on abortion represents a difficult but necessary policy shift.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Republicans are more susceptible than Democrats to the trap of equating politicians with divine figures.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Abortion had a devastating impact on the speaker’s home state of Michigan.",
